<title>USA: U.S. coffee roastings rise in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. coffee roastings rise in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Complete Coffee Coverage reported U.S. green coffee roastings as follows:</p>
<p>For the week ended August 9, roastings totaled approximately 395,000 60-kg bags, up from 365,000 bags the previous week and compared with 395,000 bags in the corresponding week one year ago.</p>
<p>Cumulative roastings totaled 10,510,000 60-kg bags, versus 10,325,000 bags in the same year-ago period.</p>
<p>((-- New York Commodity Desk, 212 859-1640))</p>
